---

---

<section class="section" id="get-started">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="start-panel reveal">
      <div class="start-copy">
        <p class="section-tag">开始使用</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">四条命令，跑起来</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          CodeY 处于 0.1.x 活跃开发阶段，暂未发布安装包，请从源码构建。<code>pnpm dev</code>
          会先构建守护进程 sidecar 和原生运行时，再启动桌面应用。
        </p>
        <div class="req-chips">
          <span>Node.js 24.12</span>
          <span>pnpm 11.7</span>
          <span>Rust 1.96+</span>
          <span>Tauri 2 系统依赖</span>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/getting-started/">查看完整指南</a>
      </div>
      <div class="start-terminal" aria-label="构建命令">
        <div class="term-bar">
          <span class="term-dot"></span>
          <span class="term-dot"></span>
          <span class="term-dot"></span>
          <span class="term-name">zsh</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="term-prompt">$</span> git clone https://github.com/ysmjjsy/CodeY.git
<span class="term-prompt">$</span> cd CodeY
<span class="term-prompt">$</span> pnpm install
<span class="term-prompt">$</span> pnpm dev
<span class="term-comment"># 首次启动后：打开项目目录 → 设置 → 模型 → 创建会话</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .start-panel {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 56px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 90% at 100% 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08), transparent),
      var(--surface);
  }

  .start-copy .section-desc code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--accent-bright);
  }

  .req-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 28px 0 32px;
  }

  .req-chips span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 5px 14px;
  }

  .start-terminal {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: #0a0a0d;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .term-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .term-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .term-name {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  .start-terminal pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 2.1;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .term-prompt {
    color: var(--accent-bright);
    user-select: none;
  }

  .term-comment {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .start-panel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 36px 28px;
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }
</style>
